### Import blood pressure CSV (REST Client - VS Code)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/import/bloodpressure
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

file=@./samples/BP.csv

### Import blood pressure CSV (curl)
# Replace /path/to/BP.csv with your local file path
# curl -v -F "file=@/path/to/BP.csv" http://localhost:5000/api/import/bloodpressure
